atlas\api\device_router.py-678-</style><main><section><h1>连接到 Atlas</h1><p>输入设备名称并提交配对申请。批准后，这个浏览器会在本机保存设备凭据并接收发给它的指令。</p><form id="pairForm"><label>设备标识<input id="deviceId" required maxlength="64" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,63}" autocomplete="username" placeholder="例如 phone-kitchen"></label><label>设备名称<input id="deviceName" required maxlength="120" placeholder="我的手机"></label><label>配对码<input id="pairCode" required minlength="8" maxlength="8" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code"></label><button>发送配对申请</button></form><div id="status" role="status"></div><div id="commands" class="hidden"><h2>设备收件箱</h2><div id="commandList"></div><button id="refresh" class="secondary" type="button">刷新指令</button><button id="disconnect" class="secondary" type="button">在此浏览器撤销登录</button></div><footer>设备凭据只保存在这个浏览器的本地存储；撤销设备配对后凭据立即失效。</footer></section></main><script>
